Following up on our call. Iran claimed to close the Strait of Hormuz again over the weekend, the same claim it has made several times this year. Brent crude moved very little, closing near 79 dollars, because shipping data now shows tankers actually moving through the strait, which is carrying more weight with the market than the claim itself. For your energy holdings, the more relevant number is Goldman''s revised 80 dollar fourth quarter forecast, which is the figure worth checking against the guidance those companies have given.<br><br>
[Your Name]<br><br>
<em>This communication is for educational purposes only and does not constitute personalized investment advice.</em>
</div>
