<p>A self directed investor holding both gold and energy names right now is absorbing two distinct macro forces, a stronger US dollar and a de escalating Iran conflict, that hit each sector differently and sometimes in opposite directions within the same sector. Without a framework for separating those forces, every mixed day in the portfolio looks like noise. An advisor''s value is in naming which force is driving which holding, so client decisions track the actual mechanism rather than the confusing daily average.</p>
